<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Train hyper-parameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Based on VERL framework, base running script is <code id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">run_gsm8k_lora.sh</code> and the training hyper-parameters are as followed(not mentioned hyper-parameters is default in GRPO algorithm.):</p>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">algorithm</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">adv_estimator</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">=</span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">grpo</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">data</span><span id="lstnumberx2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">train_batch_size</span><span id="lstnumberx2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">=128</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">data</span><span id="lstnumberx3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">max_prompt_length</span><span id="lstnumberx3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">=512</span>
</div>
